-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/9: תשלום פעימה שנייה של תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי
-- לעובדי הוראה המועסקים בבעלויות
-- The second tranche of the public-sector raise from 1.1.2012 for teaching
-- staff of the owners: tosefet 2011 completed to 4%, the shekel additions by
-- reform status, the Ofek Hadash middle-school tables and personal shekel
-- additions completed to 4%, and payment and reimbursement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/9 תשלום פעימה שנייה של תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (28.3.2012) and the lead-in following circular תשע"ב/2 of 18.9.2011: the second tranche is to be paid under the collective agreements, as below; no rule of its own.

-- The corpus nests the page's section ג (ביצוע תשלומים ושיפויים) under
-- section ב.2(ג), and gives its two paragraphs to section ב. The comments
-- use the page's letters.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: January 2012 = 5,
-- February 2012 = 6).

@desc A teaching employee's status under the Oz LaTmura reform, as section ב.1(ב) divides it.
DECLARE `reform status` IS ONE OF
    `not employed under reform terms`
    `a principal under Oz LaTmura`
    `a non-principal in partial Oz LaTmura`
    `a non-principal in full Oz LaTmura`

@desc One portion of a teaching employee's employment by an owner, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `second-tranche portion` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the portion earns tosefet 2011 under that circular (the upper division, and middle schools not under Ofek Hadash)
    `status`                             IS A `reform status`
    `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc a middle-school portion of an employee moved to Ofek Hadash terms under the agreement of 25.12.2008
    `tosefet 2011 base under circular תשע"ב/2` IS A NUMBER @desc the monthly base on which circular תשע"ב/2 computes tosefet 2011, shekels; this circular raises the rate and leaves the base to that circular
    `Ofek Hadash table salary before 1.1.2011` IS A NUMBER @desc the table salary before the update of 1.1.2011 (circular תשע"ב/2), shekels a month
    `entitled to a personal shekel addition in December 2011` IS A BOOLEAN @desc under the collective agreement of 25.12.2008
    `still entitled to it in January 2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `personal shekel addition before 1.1.2011` IS A NUMBER @desc the personal shekel addition's value before the update of 1.1.2011, shekels a month; 0 if none

DECLARE `second-tranche action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the second tranche` HAS `tranche paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner`

§§ `א תחולה`

@ref akn:art_a
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` p IF
        p's `in the teaching-staff grade`
    AND p's `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry`

§§ `ב יישום תוספת שכר בהשלמה ל-4%`

`the completed rate` MEANS 0.04

-- Section ב.1(א): from 1.1.2012 tosefet 2011 rises to a uniform 4%. The
-- base the rate is applied to is circular תשע"ב/2's, which this circular
-- does not restate: an input.
@ref akn:art_b__para_1 akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `tosefet 2011 from 1.1.2012` p IS
    IF `this circular applies to` p AND p's `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2`
    THEN `the completed rate` TIMES p's `tosefet 2011 base under circular תשע"ב/2`
    ELSE 0

-- Section ב.1(ב): the two shekel additions from 1.1.2012, by reform status.
@ref akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_b
`the shekel additions from 1.1.2012` MEANS
    LIST `shekel row` `not employed under reform terms`        153.43 170.62,
         `shekel row` `a principal under Oz LaTmura`           153.43 170.62,
         `shekel row` `a non-principal in partial Oz LaTmura`  176.67 196.46,
         `shekel row` `a non-principal in full Oz LaTmura`     215.40 239.53

@desc A row of section ב.1(ב): the shekel additions for one group.
DECLARE `shekel row` HAS
    `for status`                         IS A `reform status`
    `tosefet '94 (teaching reinforcement)` IS A NUMBER
    `tosefet '87`                        IS A NUMBER

GIVEN s IS A `reform status`
GIVETH A LIST OF `shekel row`
DECIDE `the shekel rows for` s IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `for status` EQUALS s) `the shekel additions from 1.1.2012`

-- Every status has exactly one row.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD count (`the shekel rows for` s) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST `not employed under reform terms`, `a principal under Oz LaTmura`,
                  `a non-principal in partial Oz LaTmura`, `a non-principal in full Oz LaTmura`)

GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel additions of` p IS
    IF `this circular applies to` p AND p's `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2`
    THEN sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `tosefet '94 (teaching reinforcement)` PLUS r's `tosefet '87`)
                  (`the shekel rows for` (p's `status`)))
    ELSE 0

-- Section ב.2(א)-(ב): for the Ofek Hadash middle-school portion, the tables
-- from 1.1.2012 stand 4% above their level before the update of 1.1.2011;
-- the tables are the agreement's.
@ref akn:art_b__para_2 akn:art_b__para_2__subpara_a akn:art_b__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash table salary from 1.1.2012` p IS
    IF `this circular applies to` p AND p's `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`
    THEN p's `Ofek Hadash table salary before 1.1.2011` TIMES (1 PLUS `the completed rate`)
    ELSE 0

-- Section ב.2(ג): a personal shekel addition paid in December 2011 and still
-- paid (at least) in January 2012 stands, from 1.1.2012, 4% above its value
-- before the update of 1.1.2011.
@ref akn:art_b__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the personal shekel addition is updated` p IF
        `this circular applies to` p
    AND p's `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`
    AND p's `entitled to a personal shekel addition in December 2011`
    AND p's `still entitled to it in January 2012`

GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal shekel addition from 1.1.2012` p IS
    IF `the personal shekel addition is updated` p
    THEN p's `personal shekel addition before 1.1.2011` TIMES (1 PLUS `the completed rate`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `ג ביצוע תשלומים ושיפויים`

-- akn:art_b__para_2__subpara_c__cls_c The heading of the page's section ג; the rules are its two paragraphs.

-- The page's section ג, first paragraph: the owners carry out the above
-- from the January 2012 salary.
@ref akn:art_b/p1
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `second-tranche action`
DECIDE `paying from January's salary` p IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the second tranche` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the second-tranche amounts` p
    WITHIN `month number` January
    HENCE `the Ministry's reimbursement`
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section ג: the owners carry this out from the January 2012 salary"

GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash salary from 1.1.2012` p IS
    `the Ofek Hadash table salary from 1.1.2012` p
    PLUS `the personal shekel addition from 1.1.2012` p

@export default The monthly amounts from 1.1.2012 that the second tranche sets for one portion of a teaching employee's employment by an owner under circular תשע"ב/9 — tosefet 2011, the two shekel additions, and the Ofek Hadash table and personal addition
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion` @desc the portion of employment
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the second-tranche amounts` p IS
    `tosefet 2011 from 1.1.2012` p
    PLUS `the shekel additions of` p
    PLUS `the Ofek Hadash salary from 1.1.2012` p

-- "משרד החינוך שיפה את הבעלויות … החל משכר לימוד חודש ינואר, אשר שולם
-- בראשית חודש פברואר": the Ministry reimburses from the January tuition
-- payment, paid early in February — one month after the January salary.
@ref akn:art_b/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `second-tranche action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's reimbursement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner`
    WITHIN `month number` February MINUS `month number` January
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section ג: the Ministry reimburses the owners from the January tuition payment, paid early in February"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The salary figures are round placeholders.
`a partial-Oz upper-division teacher` MEANS
    `second-tranche portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2` IS TRUE
        `status`                             IS `a non-principal in partial Oz LaTmura`
        `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`    IS FALSE
        `tosefet 2011 base under circular תשע"ב/2` IS 10000
        `Ofek Hadash table salary before 1.1.2011` IS 0
        `entitled to a personal shekel addition in December 2011` IS FALSE
        `still entitled to it in January 2012` IS FALSE
        `personal shekel addition before 1.1.2011` IS 0

#ASSERT `the second-tranche amounts` `a partial-Oz upper-division teacher` EQUALS 773.13

`an Ofek Hadash middle-school teacher with a personal addition` MEANS
    `second-tranche portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2` IS FALSE
        `status`                             IS `not employed under reform terms`
        `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`    IS TRUE
        `tosefet 2011 base under circular תשע"ב/2` IS 0
        `Ofek Hadash table salary before 1.1.2011` IS 10000
        `entitled to a personal shekel addition in December 2011` IS TRUE
        `still entitled to it in January 2012` IS TRUE
        `personal shekel addition before 1.1.2011` IS 500

#ASSERT `the second-tranche amounts` `an Ofek Hadash middle-school teacher with a personal addition` EQUALS 10920

#TRACE `paying from January's salary` `a partial-Oz upper-division teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the second tranche` 773.13 AT 5
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owner` AT 6
#TRACE `paying from January's salary` `a partial-Oz upper-division teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the second tranche` 773.13 AT 5

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: every reform status, in an Ofek Hadash
-- middle school or not, every combination of the grade, the owner, the
-- tosefet 2011 entitlement and the two personal-addition flags, and bases
-- and table salaries from 0 to 12,000 in steps of 3,000.

`every reform status` MEANS
    LIST `not employed under reform terms`, `a principal under Oz LaTmura`,
         `a non-principal in partial Oz LaTmura`, `a non-principal in full Oz LaTmura`
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`amounts checked` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k TIMES 3000) (range 0 4)

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A `reform status`, h IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, j IS A BOOLEAN, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `second-tranche portion`
DECIDE `a checked portion` g t s h d j a IS
    `second-tranche portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS g
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `entitled to tosefet 2011 under circular תשע"ב/2` IS t
        `status`                             IS s
        `in an Ofek Hadash middle school`    IS h
        `tosefet 2011 base under circular תשע"ב/2` IS a
        `Ofek Hadash table salary before 1.1.2011` IS a
        `entitled to a personal shekel addition in December 2011` IS d
        `still entitled to it in January 2012` IS j
        `personal shekel addition before 1.1.2011` IS a DIVIDED BY 10

-- Section ב.1(ב): each addition never falls as the reform goes further,
-- and a principal's row is the row of an employee not under the reform.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN i YIELD
                LET r MEANS at `the shekel additions from 1.1.2012` i
                    q MEANS at `the shekel additions from 1.1.2012` (i PLUS 1)
                IN      r's `tosefet '94 (teaching reinforcement)` AT MOST q's `tosefet '94 (teaching reinforcement)`
                    AND r's `tosefet '87` AT MOST q's `tosefet '87`)
            (range 0 2)
#ASSERT `the shekel rows for` `a principal under Oz LaTmura` EQUALS
        map (GIVEN r YIELD `shekel row` `a principal under Oz LaTmura` (r's `tosefet '94 (teaching reinforcement)`) (r's `tosefet '87`))
            (`the shekel rows for` `not employed under reform terms`)

-- Sections א and ב over every flag, status and amount: nothing for a
-- portion outside the grade; tosefet 2011 and the shekel additions exactly
-- where circular תשע"ב/2 gave tosefet 2011; the Ofek Hadash table exactly
-- 4% above its old level in such a school; the personal addition updated
-- exactly where both of its months hold; the whole never negative and
-- never falling as the amounts grow.
GIVEN p IS A `second-tranche portion`, g IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A BOOLEAN, h IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, j IS A BOOLEAN, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections א and ב hold for` p g t h d j a IF
    LET w MEANS `the second-tranche amounts` p
    IN      w AT LEAST 0
        AND (g OR w EQUALS 0)
        AND ((NOT g) OR (`the shekel additions of` p GREATER THAN 0) EQUALS t)
        AND `tosefet 2011 from 1.1.2012` p EQUALS (IF g AND t THEN 0.04 TIMES a ELSE 0)
        AND `the Ofek Hadash table salary from 1.1.2012` p EQUALS (IF g AND h THEN a TIMES 1.04 ELSE 0)
        AND `the personal shekel addition is updated` p EQUALS (g AND h AND d AND j)

#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN t YIELD
                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                all (GIVEN h YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN d YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN j YIELD
                                                        all (GIVEN a YIELD
                                                                    `sections א and ב hold for` (`a checked portion` g t s h d j a) g t h d j a
                                                                AND `the second-tranche amounts` (`a checked portion` g t s h d j a)
                                                                    AT MOST `the second-tranche amounts` (`a checked portion` g t s h d j (a PLUS 3000)))
                                                            `amounts checked`)
                                                    `both booleans`)
                                            `both booleans`)
                                    `both booleans`)
                            `every reform status`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`
